---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Build Resilience — Activist Resiliency"
  description="Long-term practices, tools, and frameworks for sustainable activism — for yourself, your team, and your organization."
  lang={lang}
>
  <section class="hub-hero">
    <div class="container hub-hero-inner">
      <h1 class="hub-heading">Build Resilience</h1>
      <p class="hub-subtitle">
        Sustainable activism requires sustained wellbeing. Choose your pathway below — whether you're working on yourself, supporting a team, or building healthier organizational structures.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pathways">
    <div class="container pathways-grid">
      <a href="/en/resilience/individuals" class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9900;</div>
        <h2 class="pathway-title">For Individuals</h2>
        <p class="pathway-description">
          Personal practices for self-regulation, recovery, and sustained wellbeing
        </p>
        <span class="pathway-link">Explore practices &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/en/resilience/organizers" class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9900;</div>
        <h2 class="pathway-title">For Organizers</h2>
        <p class="pathway-description">
          Supporting your team's wellbeing and building collective resilience
        </p>
        <span class="pathway-link">Explore practices &rarr;</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/en/resilience/organizations" class="pathway-card">
        <div class="pathway-icon" aria-hidden="true">&#9900;</div>
        <h2 class="pathway-title">For Organizations</h2>
        <p class="pathway-description">
          Building resilience into your organizational structure and culture
        </p>
        <span class="pathway-link">Explore practices &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hub-context">
    <div class="container hub-context-inner">
      <h2 class="context-heading">Why Resilience Matters for Movements</h2>
      <p class="context-body">
        The Moral Resiliency framework identifies two paths that activists tend to follow over time. The <strong>Reactive Path</strong> leads toward numbness, moral outrage that isolates, avoidance, and eventual burnout — not because activists are weak, but because unprocessed stress accumulates in the body and mind. The <strong>Resilient Path</strong> cultivates perspective, regulation, and the capacity to stay present with difficulty without being overwhelmed by it.
      </p>
      <p class="context-body">
        Resilience is not about becoming harder or more detached. It is about developing the nervous system capacity to engage fully — to feel the weight of injustice without being crushed by it, to act from values rather than reaction, and to sustain your commitment across the long arc of change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hub-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(139, 169, 138, 0.12) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .hub-hero-inner {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hub-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .hub-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    opacity: 0.8;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .pathways {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
  }

  .pathways-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .pathways-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .pathway-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-sage-light), var(--color-sage));
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-lg);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .pathway-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    color: white;
  }

  .pathway-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .pathway-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .pathway-description {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: white;
    opacity: 0.92;
    line-height: 1.6;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .pathway-link {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: white;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    display: block;
  }

  .hub-context {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .hub-context-inner {
    max-width: var(--content-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .context-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .context-body {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 72ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
</style>
